title Policy Cancellation

actor Pricer
participant RiskModule
participant Underwriter
participant PolicyPool
participant PremiumsAccount
participant USDC
participant Junior EToken
participant Senior EToken

Pricer->RiskModule:cancelPolicy(inputData)
RiskModule->Underwriter:pricePolicyCancellation(rm, inputData)
Underwriter-->RiskModule:policyToCancel, purePremiumRefund,\n jrCocRefund, srCocRefund
RiskModule->PolicyPool:cancelPolicy(policyToCancel, purePremiumRefund,\n jrCocRefund, srCocRefund)
PolicyPool->PolicyPool:validate policy is active
PolicyPool->PremiumsAccount:policyCancelled(policy, purePremiumRefund,\n jrCocRefund, srCocRefund, policyHolder)
PremiumsAccount->PremiumsAccount:activePurePremiums -= policy.purePremium
PremiumsAccount->Junior EToken:unlockScrWithRefund(jrScr, ..., policyHolder, jrCocRefund)
PremiumsAccount->Senior EToken:unlockScrWithRefund(srScr, ..., policyHolder, srCocRefund)
PremiumsAccount->USDC:transfer(policyHolder, purePremiumRefund)
opt if premiums are insufficient
PremiumsAccount->Junior EToken:internalLoan(borrow, policyHolder)
end
PolicyPool->PolicyPool:emit PolicyCancelled(policy.id,\n purePremiumRefund, jrCocRefund, srCocRefund)
